Package: quartoReactive
Title: Book-Wide Selections for Quarto HTML Documents
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pieter", "Seinen", email = "p.seinen@ggdhvb.nl",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Tom Select contributors", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "Tom Select library in inst/htmlwidgets/lib/tom-select (Apache-2.0)"),
    person("The Bootstrap Authors", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "Bootstrap Icons in inst/icons (MIT)"))
Description: Adds selection parameters to Quarto books and documents, without
    a server. Inputs set a parameter (for example the municipalities to
    compare); widgets on every page follow it. The selection persists across
    the chapters of a book and is kept in the URL so it can be shared.
    Standard widgets follow through 'crosstalk'; the package adds its own
    widgets for cases crosstalk does not cover.
